# The EURUSD volatility surface of 28 May 2024 of the rateslib cookbook (https://rateslib.com/py/en/2.7.x/z_eurusd_surface.html):
# broker quotes (ATM delta-neutral straddle, 25 and 10 delta risk reversals and market strangles), unadjusted spot delta up
# to one year and forward delta beyond, premium in USD. The forwards and spot delta factors are those of the rateslib curves
# (ESTR, SOFR and EURUSD cross-currency, rateslib 2.7.1); the reference is the rateslib FXDeltaVolSurface calibrated to the
# same quotes (a cubic spline in forward delta), evaluated at the strikes of the quotes.
